{
  "$schema": "https://vega.github.io/schema/vega/v6.json",
  "description": "A gradient legend over instants. Its scale is a colour ramp and knows nothing about time, so formatType is the only thing that makes its labels read as dates; and tickMinStep thins them the way it thins an axis's.",
